89","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20464,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为侯六悼妾六首 其五","author":"于慎行","text":"颇怪春来胜赏稀，花时无绪掩重扉。\n知君半醉诗成后，泪落床头旧舞衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20465,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为侯六悼妾六首 其六","author":"于慎行","text":"惆怅东风恨万重，难将春梦觅仙踪。\n香魂一逐行云去，知在巫山第几峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20466,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观孙山人虎丘西湖画卷 其一","author":"于慎行","text":"生平不识江南路，越水吴山寄梦游。\n为扫秋光盈片纸，却疑身在五湖舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20467,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观孙山人虎丘西湖画卷 其二","author":"于慎行","text":"姑苏台畔武林西，指点横绡咫尺迷。\n便使春游能万里，也应只作画中题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20468,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"路凤冈民部第中芭焦作花一丛百瓣诸公称为奇瑞有书见示灯下聊赋二章以寄嘉赏 其一","author":"于慎行","text":"陆地莲开世所稀，瑶台秋色转芳菲。\n湘纹已自舒歌扇，金缕还应绣舞衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20469,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"路凤冈民部第中芭焦作花一丛百瓣诸公称为奇瑞有书见示灯下聊赋二章以寄嘉赏 其二","author":"于慎行","text":"莫向秋声问是非，绿云红雨正霏微。\n总疑覆鹿全非梦，蝴蝶枝头底又飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20470,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方山别后得冯少宰寄诗赋答口号","author":"于慎行","text":"不堪别思倚高秋，人自魂销水自流。\n莫问留侯何事业，只今已伴赤松游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20471,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日过二兄石淙别业同游洪范东流用韵六首 其三","author":"于慎行","text":"两代豪华尽可哀，中丞楼榭故侯台。\n多情惟有东流水，依旧声从树杪来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20472,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日过二兄石淙别业同游洪范东流用韵六首 其五","author":"于慎行","text":"古庙空坛枕石城，残碑埋没落花平。\n池边何代长杨树，呜咽寒涛作雨声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20473,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老君岩","author":"于慎行","text":"万仞峰头碧玉坛，丹霞为佩月为冠。\n应知一化金仙后，象教唯从过去看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20474,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朗公石","author":"于慎行","text":"朗公已逐诸缘灭，此石何缘号朗公。\n莫向精魂论片石，都无生灭是真空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20475,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送可大行方山道中二绝 其一","author":"于慎行","text":"马上朝朝望翠微，山中处处有泉飞。\n人间岐路能如此，半点红尘不上衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20476,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送可大行方山道中二绝 其二","author":"于慎行","text":"烟林六月早凉生，夹道青山画不成。\n流水亦知人送客，潺湲学作断肠声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20477,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牛山赠百岁僧二绝 其一","author":"于慎行","text":"百岁真僧住翠微，白毫光散六铢衣。\n逢迎犹自过山半，指点岩泉步似飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20478,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牛山赠百岁僧二绝 其二","author":"于慎行","text":"匡床一钵饱胡麻，不记山中岁月赊。\n惟有少时松桂在，眼看落尽六朝花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20479,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题文学郑生墨海壶天卷二首 其一","author":"于慎行","text":"长安可识鲁诸生，笔底龙鸾到处惊。\n好去汉宫题署榜，今年太极殿新成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20480,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题文学郑生墨海壶天卷二首 其二","author":"于慎行","text":"戏取刀圭鍊紫霞，壶天深驻上仙家。\n等閒种就千林杏，开作宜春内苑花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20481,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郭汝承诗有乡思书此解之","author":"于慎行","text":"十年几作五陵游，一剑高横万里秋。\n此夜龙光方射斗，乡心且莫视刀头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20482,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆课灯市八韵","author":"于慎行","text":"燕市风光傍帝台，上元灯火欲重开。\n五城绣箔连云起，九陌笙歌动地来。\n翡翠妆成花下翥，芙蓉擎出日边栽。\n雕鞍马上迷芳草，锦瑟楼中醉落梅。\n遥见银花随月合，不教玉漏逐人催。\n九天乍转迎春仗，三殿行传上寿杯。\n豹髓鸾膏浑费尽，看调玉烛咏明哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20483,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王对南太史奉使蜀藩册封十韵","author":"于慎行","text":"持节兰台著作郎，绯衣朝下出明光。\n千秋茅土传新渥，三晋云山识旧乡。\n马度宜春花似雨，鸡鸣函谷月如霜。\n雄图百二蝉声里，栈阁三千鸟道傍。\n负弩奔趋巴郡吏，开函拜舞汉亲王。\n锦官城入空江断，玉垒霞连太白长。\n载酒能过扬子宅，浣花试访杜陵庄。\n朱门旭日当筵醉，碧草轻烟满路香。\n一鹤只今天外去，双鱼可遣岁前将。\n离心不尽青骊远，渺渺平芜对夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20484,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日村居四十二首 其一","author":"于慎行","text":"槛外千山过雨，阶前独树含风。\n座对山光晓暮，床随树影西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20485,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日村居四十二首 其二","author":"于慎行","text":"地僻炎天不暑，心空小阁常宽。\n隐几山当睥睨，钩帘月上阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20486,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日村居四十二首 其三","author":"于慎行","text":"乞竹多烦问讯，栽花每费平章。\n亦自开成三径，相过惜少求羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20487,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日村居四十二首 其四","author":"于慎行","text":"云里青山尽处，花间流水来时。\n行负鸱夷载酒，吟挥麈尾成诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20488,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日村居四十二首 其五","author":"于慎行","text":"蝴蝶飞来栩栩，蚍蜉战罢蘧蘧。\n枕上惊消宿酒，掌中闪落残书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":20489,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]